<title>USA: Living Centers names Charles Carden CFO.</title>
<headline>Living Centers names Charles Carden CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Living Centers of America Inc said on Tuesday it has appointed Charles Carden as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Carden, who was previously senior vice president and chief financial officer at Leaseway Transportation Corp, will be responsible for the Company's finance, treasury, reimbursement, tax and audit activities.</p>
<p>Lee Williams, who steps down as chief financial officer, continues as president and chief operating officer, a spokeswoman said.</p>
